      "content": "The large variance in hop times between 2 and 3 suggests that the packet loss and high jitter are more related to routing or transport layer issues rather than a physical layer problem. Flight delay or routing scalability around yourADC/Router could be a factor. The difference in hop times between packets traveling through the same physical link is often an indication of routing or traffic congestion.",
