      "content": "cpu looks fine on the router and the vlan config is standard. i'm also seeing some weird intermittent drops on the management interface too. it's almost like something is randomly tapping into the stream or messing with the timing. \n\ncould it be some kind of transient hardware glitch or interference that doesn't show up in the bit error rate? any idea what kind of \"ghost\" issues we should be hunting for in the logs?",
